  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 26</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mæssepreost manslaga wurðe oððe elles mánweorc to swiðe gewurce, þonne þolige he ægðres ge hádes gé éardes ⁊ wræcnige swa wíde swa papa him scrife ⁊ dædbete georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a priest commits homicide or perpetrates any other great crime, he shall be deprived of his ecclesiastical office and likewise banished, and shall travel as a pilgrim as far as the Pope appoints for him, and zealously make amends.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
